{"1":{"ar":"قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ","en":"Say, \"He is Allah, [who is] One,","tj":"قُلْ هُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهُ أَحَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>د</tajweed>ٌ <span class=end>١</span>","pg":604},"2":{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ","en":"Allah, the Eternal Refuge.","tj":"ٱللَّهُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّمَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>د</tajweed>ُ <span class=end>٢</span>","pg":604},"3":{"ar":"لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ","en":"He neither begets nor is born,","tj":"لَمْ يَلِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> وَلَمْ يُولَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> <span class=end>٣</span>","pg":604},"4":{"ar":"وَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدٌۢ","en":"Nor is there to Him any equivalent.\"","tj":"وَلَمْ يَك<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ُن ل</tajweed>َّهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> كُفُوًا أَحَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>د</tajweed>ُۢ <span class=end>٤</span>","pg":604}}